      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Furious that Senya and Fedya kidnapped a reporter, Nagiyev heads out with them to fix the mess before the police get involved. Meanwhile in the kitchen, Nastya tells Max that the vegetarian guest loved the morning dish so much he ordered a second helping.",
